 "transcript": [
  "[action] goes to see father",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I should have been made an officer long ago and not my brother. He is still only a son and yet he is already setting up a great market,\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) looks at eldest son",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"And now I see what is in your mind,\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) goes to eldest son",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung sits beside his eldest son.",
  "[action] (to the second son) Eldest son watches his brother.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung expresses his lack of ambition.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"I have had enough of these things.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"I do not know what it is that moves you in your heart. If you will have it so, do what you like and I will not question it.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"It is all your fault, father, for giving me so little.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what now?\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung listens to his son.",
  "[action] (to the second son) Eldest son looks at second son.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Is there some thing else?\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) Second son shrinks away from father.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"No, no,\"",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"I have nothing to tell.\"",
  "[action] Eldest son walks away in silence."
